    starters: ['Write a thematic literature review from these papers.', 'Which findings do these papers agree on and where do they conflict?', 'Build a synthesis table: study, design, sample, measures, main finding.', 'Group these papers by theory or method rather than by date.', 'What is the gap these papers leave open for my question?', 'Which studies are the strongest and why?', 'Rewrite my review so it argues rather than lists paper after paper.', 'Which papers cite each other and which ignore each other?', 'Draft the two-paragraph state of the art for my introduction.'],
